step	65	-	Quick guide step 65
line	<str>Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>(optional) Note to Ironmen: if you do not have a death talisman, search the bookshelves for a book titled Prifddinas' history. You might need it later as part of the 50 items and this will allow you to potentially save time and a charge on your teleport.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wearing your mourner gear, talk to Essyllt under the hideout in West Ardougne (north-east corner of town). He gives you the new key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run west through the cave, keep going until you find the dead bodies. There will be a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search a guard corpse for Edern's journal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the red line in the map to get to the black crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your chisel to chip off a piece.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return and talk to Arianwyn in Lletya to enchant your crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Temple of Light.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the eastern set stairs, that are directly in front of the entrance, to the middle floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the area indicated by the rope on the guide map and use your rope on the rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Drop your new key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the area marked with mirror #1 just east of the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the crystal dispenser on the wall to reset the puzzle and then collect all of the items which includes mirrors and a Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place Hand mirror Mirror #1 to shine the light north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #2 points west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #3 points south.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal. The light will turn yellow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #4 points east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cross the gap to the other side. Use any agility boosts you have. You will have to cross this gap a second time later.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the chest to obtain 2 mirrors and a Cyan crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Cyan crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reset the puzzle at the crystal dispenser and collect all items.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #1 points north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #2 points west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the Cyan crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Cyan crystal. The light will turn cyan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #3 points north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #4 points east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal. The light will turn green.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the chest to obtain 2 mirrors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Do NOT reset the puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal and replace it with Hand mirror Mirror #5 pointing up to the top floor. Long side of the mirror should be pointing east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb the north ladder to the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #6 points west. The light to the west turns blue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the middle floor and take the south stairs up to the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #7 points down toward the middle floor. Long side of the mirror should be pointing east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb to the bottom floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Hand mirror Mirror #8, going through the eastern yellow barrier. Turn Hand mirror Mirror #8 to point south.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the southern barrier and follow the path. Open the chest to obtain 2 mirrors and a Fractured crystal (horizontal)|txt=Fractured crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back through the southern barrier and rotate the mirror to point east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit through the eastern barrier.</str>
line	
line	<str>Do NOT reset the puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the east stairs to the middle floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take out the Cyan crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Cyan crystal and place the Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal instead. The light will now be yellow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the south ladder to the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Rotate Hand mirror Mirror #7 to shine the light south. This light should be red. Run south to mirror 8.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #8 point down toward the middle floor. Long side of the mirror should be pointing north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the south ladder to the middle floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the rope shortcut to reach the bottom floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Hand mirror Mirror #9 and open the chest to obtain a Blue crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Blue crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Reset the puzzle</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #1 points north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #2 points west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #3 points south.</str>
