line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #6 points the eastern light up.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb the east stairs to the middle floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the Yellow crystal (Mourning's End Part II)|txt=Yellow crystal. The light will turn yellow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the north ladder to the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hand mirror Mirror #7 points west. You should see the light turn red at the pillar to the west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the north ladder to the middle floor.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Climb up the south ladder to the top floor.</col>
step	87	-	Quick guide step 87
